  "summary": "## Summary: Commit Changes for Intelligent Error Recovery\n\n### Commit Details\n\n**Commit Hash:** `fa43b7dba2ea68122f5caeea0523f0ecf47c8051`\n**Commit Type:** `refactor`\n**Commit Scope:** `recovery`\n\n### Commit Message\n\n```\nrefactor(recovery): improve error recovery module code quality\n\nCode review improvements to the error recovery module:\n\n- Add iterative _fibonacci() helper for efficient backoff calculation\n- Add __repr__ and summary() methods to RecoveryStats for debugging\n- Fix RecoveryContext.__exit__ with proper return type and exception logging\n- Add missing track_failures parameter to create_recovery_config_from_dict\n- Remove duplicate docstrings in FrameRecoveryManager and ModelFallbackChain\n- Export error detection substring constants (OOM, CUDA, TIMEOUT)\n```\n\n### Files Committed\n\n| File | Changes |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/video2d3d/utils/error_recovery.py` | +76 lines, -30 lines |\n| `src/video2d3d/utils/__init__.py` | +8 lines |\n\n### Changes Committed\n\n1. **`_fibonacci()` Helper Function** - Added iterative Fibonacci calculation to avoid list-building overhead during backoff calculation\n\n2. **`RecoveryStats` Enhancements** - Added `__repr__()` for debugging and `summary()` for human-readable statistics\n\n3. **`RecoveryContext.__exit__` Fix** - Added proper `bool` return type, exception logging, and explicit `return False`\n\n4. **`create_recovery_config_from_dict` Fix** - Added missing `track_failures` parameter\n\n5. **Docstring Cleanup** - Removed duplicate `Example usage:` blocks in `FrameRecoveryManager` and `ModelFallbackChain`\n\n6. **Export Updates** - Added `OOM_ERROR_SUBSTRINGS`, `CUDA_ERROR_SUBSTRINGS`, `TIMEOUT_ERROR_SUBSTRINGS` to exports\n\n### Notes\n\n- All changes maintain backward compatibility\n- No breaking changes introduced\n- Code quality improvements following code review findings"
